<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f4eee2" />
  <meta name="description" content="Sala de chat anônima e temporária do chat realtime." />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />

  <title>sala <%= roomId %> — chat realtime</title>

  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css?v=5" />
</head>

<body class="chat-page" data-room="<%= roomId %>">
  <%- include("partials/icons") %>

  <div class="chat-shell">
    <aside id="sidebar" class="chat-sidebar" aria-label="Informações da sala">
      <div class="sidebar-head">
        <a class="brand brand-light" href="/" aria-label="chat realtime, início">
          <img src="/logo.svg" alt="" class="brand-mark" width="32" height="32" />
          <span class="brand-name">chat realtime</span>
        </a>
        <button type="button" id="close-sidebar" class="icon-btn sidebar-close" aria-label="Fechar menu">
          <svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-close"></use></svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <section class="room-card" aria-labelledby="room-card-title">
        <span class="room-card-label" id="room-card-title">sala atual</span>
        <div class="room-card-code">
          <code id="sidebar-room-code"><%= roomId %></code>
          <button type="button" id="copy-room" class="icon-btn icon-btn-sm" aria-label="Copiar código da sala" title="Copiar código">
            <svg class="icon icon-sm"><use href="#icon-copy"></use></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
        <p>manda o link pra alguém. quem entrar, entra na conversa.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="members-section" aria-labelledby="members-title">
        <div class="section-line">
          <h2 id="members-title">
            <svg class="icon icon-xs"><use href="#icon-users"></use></svg>
            quem tá aqui
          </h2>
          <span id="member-count" class="count-badge">0</span>
        </div>
        <ul id="member-list" class="member-list" aria-live="polite"></ul>
      </section>

      <div class="sidebar-spacer"></div>

      <div class="sidebar-note">
        <svg class="icon icon-sm"><use href="#icon-lock"></use></svg>
        <p>as mensagens ficam na memória. a sala some depois de 1 hora vazia.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sidebar-foot">
        <button type="button" id="leave-room" class="btn btn-ghost btn-block">
          <svg class="icon icon-sm"><use href="#icon-close"></use></svg>
          Sair da sala
        </button>
        <a class="sidebar-hosted" href="https://zenifra.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">hospedado na Zenifra</a>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <div id="sidebar-backdrop" class="sidebar-backdrop is-hidden"></div>

    <main class="chat-main">
      <header class="chat-header">
        <button type="button" id="open-sidebar" class="icon-btn mobile-menu" aria-label="Abrir menu da sala">
          <svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-menu"></use></svg>
        </button>

        <div class="chat-heading">
          <span class="chat-kicker">sala</span>
          <h1>#<span id="header-room-code"><%= roomId %></span></h1>
        </div>

        <div class="chat-header-actions">
          <span id="connection-pill" class="connection-pill is-connecting">
            <span class="connection-dot"></span>
            <span id="connection-label">conectando...</span>
          </span>
          <button type="button" id="copy-link" class="icon-btn" aria-label="Copiar link da sala" title="Copiar link">
            <svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-copy"></use></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div id="connection-banner" class="connection-banner is-hidden" role="status">
        <svg class="icon icon-sm"><use href="#icon-alert"></use></svg>
        <span id="connection-banner-text">a conexão caiu. tentando de novo...</span>
        <button type="button" id="reconnect-button" class="btn btn-soft btn-sm">
          <svg class="icon icon-xs"><use href="#icon-refresh"></use></svg>
          Reconectar
        </button>
      </div>

      <section id="messages" class="messages" aria-label="Mensagens da sala" role="log" aria-live="polite">
        <div id="empty-state" class="empty-state">
          <span class="empty-icon">
            <svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-chat"></use></svg>
          </span>
          <h2>Ninguém falou nada ainda.</h2>
          <p>Manda a primeira e quebra o gelo.</p>
          <button type="button" id="empty-copy" class="btn btn-soft btn-sm">
            <svg class="icon icon-xs"><use href="#icon-copy"></use></svg>
            Copiar link da sala
          </button>
        </div>
        <div id="messages-list" class="messages-list"></div>
      </section>

      <button type="button" id="scroll-bottom" class="scroll-bottom">
        novas mensagens
        <svg class="icon icon-sm"><use href="#icon-arrow-down"></use></svg>
      </button>

      <div id="typing-indicator" class="typing-indicator" aria-live="polite"></div>

      <footer class="composer-area">
        <div id="file-chips" class="file-chips"></div>

        <form id="composer-form" class="composer">
          <label class="attach-btn" for="file-input" title="Anexar arquivo" aria-label="Anexar arquivo">
            <svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-paperclip"></use></svg>
            <input id="file-input" type="file" multiple hidden
              accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/gif,video/mp4,video/webm,application/pdf,text/plain" />
          </label>

          <textarea id="message-input" rows="1" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Manda uma mensagem..." aria-label="Mensagem" disabled></textarea>

          <button type="submit" id="send-button" class="send-btn" disabled aria-label="Mandar mensagem" title="Mandar (Enter)">
            <svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-send"></use></svg>
          </button>
        </form>

        <div class="composer-meta">
          <span id="char-count">0 / 1000</span>
          <span class="composer-hint">Enter manda · Shift + Enter quebra linha</span>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>

  <div id="join-overlay" class="modal-layer" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="join-title">
    <div class="modal-card">
      <img src="/logo.svg" alt="" class="modal-logo" width="44" height="44" />
      <span class="eyebrow">sala <code><%= roomId %></code></span>
      <h2 id="join-title">Entra na conversa</h2>
      <p id="join-subtitle" class="modal-subtitle">Como você quer aparecer?</p>

      <form id="join-form" novalidate>
        <label class="field">
          <span>Seu nome</span>
          <input id="join-name" type="text" maxlength="24" autocomplete="nickname" placeholder="Como te chamam?" />
        </label>
        <p id="join-error" class="form-error is-hidden" role="alert"></p>
        <button type="submit" id="join-submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">
          <span class="btn-label" id="join-submit-label">Entrar</span>
          <span class="btn-spinner is-hidden" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </button>
      </form>

      <a class="modal-back" href="/">voltar pro início</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="toast-stack" class="toast-stack" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="false"></div>

  <noscript>
    <div class="noscript-message">O chat realtime precisa de JavaScript para funcionar.</div>
  </noscript>

  <script src="/socket.io/socket.io.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/room.js?v=5" defer></script>
</body>

</html>
